      "title": "鼻はナポレオンより前から欠けていた",
      "text": "The Sphinx's nose was already gone before Napoleon. Drawings by the Danish traveler Frederic Norden, who visited in the 1730s, already show the face without its nose. They were printed long before Napoleon came to Egypt in 1798.",
